tial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: $e^{At} = \\begin{bmatrix}\\cosh (2t) & \\sinh (2t) \\\\ \\sinh (2t) & \\cosh (2t)\\end{bmatrix}$, where $A = \\begin{bmatrix}0 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 0\\end{bmatrix}$.*"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311561 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229143 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d611c75-818f-508f-a7a4-49edb32baa41" :knowledge-point/title "Solving a Homogeneous Initial Value Problem Using a Given Matrix Exponential"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "475bc880-3247-5ccb-b66d-eadc8b060abd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309293} {:answer/id #uuid "49f14ac6-ae6a-52fb-ac47-59a4da45cbf2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -7\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309314} {:answer/id #uuid "dddc0c7d-92d4-5f6a-896b-0827b4812b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310526} {:answer/id #uuid "e3ce61e9-90fc-5364-9639-0f81ce141cae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-7\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310567} {:answer/id #uuid "edf565d5-c17e-5fec-b7c6-a3893ad155fb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310642}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "dddc0c7d-92d4-5f6a-896b-0827b4812b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310526} :answer-field/id #uuid "6a3f0017-0fc8-57f5-b880-e66a5a5ec724" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186311073}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "0363c023-46f1-587f-a57b-04e2d2812056" :question/math-academy-id "q-335265" :question/problem "$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t) &=7y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t) &=7x(t),\\end{aligned}\\right.\\,\\begin{bmatrix}x(0) \\\\ y(0)\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nFind the solution to the initial value problem above.\n\n*Hint: ${e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix},$ where $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$*" :question/worked-solution "Writing our system in matrix form, we get\n\n$$\n{x}^{′}(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}x(t),\n$$\n\nwhere $x(t)=\\begin{bmatrix}x(t) \\\\ y(t)\\end{bmatrix}.$ So, the matrix of the system is $A=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 7 \\\\ 7 & 0\\end{bmatrix}.$\n\nGiven the system ${x}^{′}(t)=Ax(t),$ where $A$ is a constant square matrix, the solution of the initial value problem can be written as\n\n$$\nx(t)={Φ}_{0}(t)\\,x(0),\n$$\n\nwhere ${Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}$ is the standard fundamental matrix of the system, and $x(0)$ is the initial condition vector.\n\nNow, using the given information, the standard fundamental matrix ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{Φ}_{0}(t)={e}^{At}=\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x(t) & ={e}^{At}\\,x(0) \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ \\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) & \\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-\\operatorname{sinh}⁡(7t) \\\\ -\\operatorname{cosh}⁡(7t)\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311712 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186229145 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "1ff837c0-0ebb-5a9e-acb4-894261e0318c" :knowledge-point/title "Proving the Matrix Exponential Formula for IVP Solution: Homogeneous Systems"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1c34b001-8f8c-572c-b23f-54c9b0c5e906" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "using the initial condition ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186308966} {:answer/id #uuid "2cf1caf8-52d6-5aa2-81ff-73de1341e51f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "evaluating ${Φ}_{0}(t)$ at $t=1$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309083} {:answer/id #uuid "3eb387de-5087-5640-92ef-cfd3eaef730a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "using the initial condition ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309223} {:answer/id #uuid "487cf069-3ce8-55d6-8f31-00a5f9dc3430" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "computing $det({Φ}_{0}(0))$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309301} {:answer/id #uuid "8b861976-a2d2-5456-8f84-3e614119c072" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "applying the chain rule to ${Φ}_{0}(0)$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309850}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3eb387de-5087-5640-92ef-cfd3eaef730a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "using the initial condition ${Φ}_{0}(0)={I}_{n}$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309223} :answer-field/id #uuid "746ca404-3ff2-5606-b348-9000ebf3fa